('121.mp4', 'Nature: desert, sand dunes. Objects: sand vortex, dust devil. Actions: swirling, rising, twisting. Scenes: desert landscape. Emotions: serene, dramatic. Concepts: natural phenomenon, wind', 'Nature: desert, sand dunes. Objects: sand vortex, dust devil. Actions: swirling, rising, twisting. S...', 'desert, sand dunes, sand vortex, dust devil, swirling, rising, twisting, desert landscape, serene, dramatic, natural phenomenon, wind', 'A swirling sand vortex rises dramatically from the desert floor, twisting gracefully against a backdrop of rolling dunes. The sunlight casts a warm glow over the scene, highlighting the intricate patterns of the sand in motion.', 'A swirling dust devil dances across the sandy dunes under a bright sky. The twisting column of sand creates an intricate pattern as it moves gracefully through the desert landscape.', NULL, '1088x1888', '34:59', 30.0, '5s'),
