('124.mp4', 'People: workers, diners, men. Nature: tree, greenery. Objects: wooden house, woven mats, bowl of rice, food, scaffolding. Actions: eating, building, sitting. Emotions: communal, harmonious, camaraderie. Scenes: construction site, outdoor dining, outdoor meal. Concepts: community, collaboration, tradition', 'People: workers, diners, men. Nature: tree, greenery. Objects: wooden house, woven mats, bowl of ric...', 'workers, diners, men, tree, greenery, wooden house, woven mats, bowl of rice, food, scaffolding, eating, building, sitting, communal, harmonious, camaraderie, construction site, outdoor dining, outdoor meal, community, collaboration, tradition', 'A group of people are gathered outdoors, sharing a meal on woven mats, surrounded by lush greenery. In the background, a wooden house is under construction with workers actively engaged in building activities. The scene captures a harmonious blend of communal dining and collaborative work.', 'A group of men sit on woven mats enjoying a communal meal in front of a traditional wooden house under construction. The house is elevated on stilts with bamboo scaffolding, and several workers are seen actively building. The scene is set outdoors under a large tree, with dappled sunlight filtering through the leaves.', NULL, '1080x1920', '9:16', 30.0, '5s'),
